        'In triangle $XYZ$, $x = 5$ cm, $y = 7$ cm and $\angle Z = 60°$. Find $z$, correct to one decimal place.',
        null,
        'Cosine rule: $z^{2} = x^{2} + y^{2} - 2xy\cos Z$

$z^{2} = 25 + 49 - 2(5)(7)(0.5) = 74 - 35 = 39$

